From 7a5118411229c265073ab783a872c0fbbe21659d Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Simon Maurer <mail@maurer.systems>
Date: Wed, 18 Mar 2026 17:22:44 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] drivers: remoteproc: add OpenAMP remote-side driver

Add a RemoteProc driver implementation for the remote processor based on
the OpenAMP library.

This driver acts as the counterpart to the Linux remoteproc framework and
includes support for generating the resource table from devicetree as well
as an RPMsg VirtIO device driver.

Signed-off-by: Simon Maurer <mail@maurer.systems>
